00:16:37.640 --> 00:16:38.800
And your spirit's glum

00:16:38.800 --> 00:16:40.420
And you feel you can't see straight

00:16:42.680 --> 00:16:50.060
Sure, soon you'll be fe-

00:16:50.060 --> 00:16:50.720
For a shot of-

00:17:10.204 --> 00:17:10.704
HOP

00:17:31.660 --> 00:17:32.660
Get yourself outside.

00:17:34.740 --> 00:17:35.560
Nature will put a...

00:17:40.670 --> 00:17:42.150
Okay, okay, I'm outside.

00:17:42.320 --> 00:17:43.780
I'm all good now, okay?

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:45.320
I'll just be heading back home

00:17:45.320 --> 00:17:47.060
so I can go build my Squeakasaurus Rex.

00:17:47.660 --> 00:17:50.080
Here, how?

00:17:51.240 --> 00:17:52.480
Let's go for a nice walk

00:17:52.480 --> 00:17:54.240
and let nature help you feel better.

00:17:55.210 --> 00:17:56.550
Ugh, this is so unfair.

00:17:56.910 --> 00:17:59.430
I should be inside with my Squeakasaurus Rex.

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:02.360
Why don't we just focus on other things for a while, Hal?

00:18:02.600 --> 00:18:03.400
Like what?

00:18:04.350 --> 00:18:06.750
About the gentle breeze blowing on your face.

00:18:10.220 --> 00:18:12.140
Oh, hey, that does feel kind of nice.

00:18:13.540 --> 00:18:15.000
It kind of tickles.

00:18:15.950 --> 00:18:17.630
Now take a deep breath through your nose

00:18:17.630 --> 00:18:19.650
and tell Dr. Daisy what you smell.

00:18:21.640 --> 00:18:23.640
Ooh, I smell fresh-cut grass.

00:18:25.400 --> 00:18:29.970
And I smell la...

00:18:34.080 --> 00:18:40.540
I smell lilac and lilies of the valley!

00:18:40.860 --> 00:18:43.530
I always like to smell flowers for my nature dose.

00:18:43.750 --> 00:18:46.910
The scent just clears my head and makes me feel so happy

00:18:46.910 --> 00:18:50.610
and nature-y and all at the same time saying how...

00:18:50.760 --> 00:18:51.960
I sure do, Daisy!

00:19:00.280 --> 00:19:02.980
Ooh, ooh, I heard it. It was a spring peeper.

00:19:03.260 --> 00:19:05.160
Well, it sounds to me like a squeak toy.

00:19:06.100 --> 00:19:09.460
I gotta get back home. I need to finish Squeak-a-saurus ranch.

00:19:09.600 --> 00:19:10.300
Hold on, Hal.

00:19:11.480 --> 00:19:12.920
...do a follow-up examination.

00:19:15.650 --> 00:19:17.270
Oh, no, you're not cured yet.

00:19:18.380 --> 00:19:18.860
I'm not?

00:19:19.400 --> 00:19:19.700
Nope.

00:19:20.220 --> 00:19:21.720
Get a stronger dose of nature.

00:19:21.960 --> 00:19:23.720
Or maybe just a different kind of dose.

00:19:24.260 --> 00:19:25.000
Everybody's different.

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:29.970
Yep, all right, this feels good. Nature work, now...

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:33.080
time to go back home and finish up my squeak-a-saurus rex. Bye, nature!

00:19:33.400 --> 00:19:38.610
Not yet, Hal. First, just lie here and feel your weight sink into the grass.

00:19:41.900 --> 00:19:48.010
Yeah, ma'am. This is how I do my nature dose. Relaxing in the grass. Get your troubles.

00:19:49.180 --> 00:19:50.570
Come on. Get happy.

00:19:50.940 --> 00:19:55.740
It is relaxing. Nature is just what the doctor ordered.

00:19:55.920 --> 00:19:58.680
Oh, hey! Look at the clouds!

00:19:59.200 --> 00:19:59.960
Watching the clouds.

00:20:00.120 --> 00:20:03.680
gently float by is my nature prescription.

00:20:04.280 --> 00:20:06.340
Hey, that cloud looks like a kite.

00:20:08.450 --> 00:20:10.190
And that one looks like a train.

00:20:10.650 --> 00:20:15.720
Those clouds look like cheese!

00:20:16.710 --> 00:20:18.450
Yeah! Cheese cloud!

00:20:19.370 --> 00:20:22.230
This was a great idea, Dr. Daisy.

00:20:22.890 --> 00:20:24.370
Hal seems very relaxed.

00:20:24.690 --> 00:20:26.570
Ooh, look, that cloud looks just like...

00:20:27.240 --> 00:20:28.180
It looks just like...

00:20:28.420 --> 00:20:29.860
Glicosaurus Rex!

00:20:30.320 --> 00:20:34.140
Wait, I clearly haven't hatched her yet.

00:20:34.460 --> 00:20:35.560
It doesn't matter.

00:20:35.720 --> 00:20:37.360
I have to go finish Squeakasaurus Rex.

00:20:38.060 --> 00:20:40.050
Wait, guys, hatched more.

00:20:40.700 --> 00:20:41.920
I have to spill.

00:20:42.300 --> 00:20:43.320
Tally-ho!

00:20:48.480 --> 00:20:50.080
Away, catch me!

00:21:02.650 --> 00:21:03.670
Pretty good with bushes, huh?

00:21:04.030 --> 00:21:04.310
But ow!

00:21:10.900 --> 00:21:14.380
Yeah, that's a swing!

00:21:21.700 --> 00:21:22.160
I got high!

00:21:30.600 --> 00:21:32.280
This is so muddy and awesome!

00:21:32.710 --> 00:21:34.810
We are so gonna catch you!

00:21:35.600 --> 00:21:37.700
Not if you can't find me!

00:21:38.140 --> 00:21:39.170
You don't mean!

00:21:39.560 --> 00:21:40.800
Why is that you mean?

00:21:41.000 --> 00:21:42.120
Hide and go sink!

00:21:43.540 --> 00:21:45.040
Hide and go sink, you guys!

00:21:45.290 --> 00:21:46.690
We're playing and go-

00:21:58.550 --> 00:21:59.570
Picking up your scent ha-

00:22:02.110 --> 00:22:02.370
How?

00:22:02.860 --> 00:22:03.640
But you are cute.

00:22:08.690 --> 00:22:10.610
I'll come out wherever you are.

00:22:12.440 --> 00:22:12.640
Huh?

00:22:16.970 --> 00:22:22.470
Oh, boy.

00:22:23.110 --> 00:22:24.650
I love hide-and-go-seek.

00:22:24.810 --> 00:22:25.690
Oh, can I be it now?

00:22:25.770 --> 00:22:26.910
Can I, can I please, please, please?

00:22:27.050 --> 00:22:27.690
Can I be it now?

00:22:27.990 --> 00:22:29.860
Sure, but first, tell Dr.

00:22:30.890 --> 00:22:35.870
I feel great! I mean, all this running around and playing outside gives me so much energy!

00:22:36.170 --> 00:22:39.470
And it makes me feel happy! And it cleared up my fuzzy brain!

00:22:39.870 --> 00:22:42.730
This is definitely the kind of nature dose I need!

00:22:43.140 --> 00:22:46.580
Sweet! I told you nature would help you feel better!

00:22:46.820 --> 00:22:49.360
Yup! Next time you have a fuzzy brain...

00:22:49.360 --> 00:22:50.500
VIVA LA NATURE!

00:22:51.400 --> 00:22:54.310
But, uh, what about the you-know-what?

00:22:54.600 --> 00:22:56.460
The you-know-what? What? Who?

00:22:56.850 --> 00:22:59.800
You know, the squeak-a-saurus rat.

00:23:00.440 --> 00:23:06.680
I'm going to finish it later. Right now, I need a little more outside.

00:23:07.300 --> 00:23:10.400
Now you guys go hide and I'll count.

00:23:11.000 --> 00:23:14.780
I hope I don't hide by accident and forget. I do that a lot sometimes.

